{
  vertexes: [
    {
      id: "1"
      L: Page
      P: {
        fns: return { enabled: () => true }
        title: Documentation - Decode Files Organizer
        url: /docs
        key: ShopifyFileDocumentation
        props:
          '''return {
  isNoPermissionCheck: true
}'''
      }
    }
    {
      id: "2"
      L: Attr
      P: {
        css:
          '''return `._id {
  max-width: 800px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: ${args.theme.var.spacing?.lg || "2rem"};
  color: ${args.theme.var.color.text};
}

@media (max-width: 768px) {
  ._id {
    padding: ${args.theme.var.spacing?.md || "1rem"};
  }
}`;'''
        displayOrder: 1
        componentName: Html
        props:
          '''return {
  as: "div"
}'''
      }
    }
    {
      id: "3"
      L: Attr
      P: {
        css:
          '''return `._id {
  font-size: 2rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: ${args.theme.var.color.text};
  margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
}

@media (max-width: 768px) {
  ._id {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
  }
}`;'''
        displayOrder: 1
        componentName: Html
        props:
          '''return {
  as: "h1",
  text: "Documentation"
}'''
      }
    }
    {
      id: "4"
      L: Attr
      P: {
        css:
          '''return `._id {
  font-size: 0.9375rem;
  line-height: 1.6;
  color: ${args.theme.var.color.muted};
  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
}`;'''
        displayOrder: 2
        textType: markdown
        componentName: Html
        text:
          '''This guide explains how to use the **Decode Files Organizer** app in plain language. You don't need any technical knowledge—just follow along.
'''
        props:
          '''return {
  as: "p",
}'''
      }
    }
    {
      id: "5"
      L: Attr
      P: {
        css:
          '''return `._id {
  margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
}`;'''
        displayOrder: 3
        componentName: Html
        props:
          '''return {
  as: "div"
}'''
      }
    }
    {
      id: "6"
      L: Attr
      P: {
        css:
          '''return `._id {
  font-size: 1.25rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: ${args.theme.var.color.text};
  margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
}`;'''
        displayOrder: 1
        componentName: Html
        props:
          '''return {
  as: "h2",
  text: "Getting around the app"
}'''
      }
    }
    {
      id: "7"
      L: Attr
      P: {
        css:
          '''return `._id {
  font-size: 0.9375rem;
  line-height: 1.6;
  color: ${args.theme.var.color.muted};
  margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
}`;'''
        displayOrder: 2
        textType: markdown
        componentName: Html
        text: In the Shopify admin main sidebar you'll see a menu **Decode Files Organizer** with links: [Files](/files), [Support](/support), [FAQ](/faq), [Documentation](/docs), [Billing](/billing), and [Privacy](/privacy). Click any link to go to that section.
        props:
          '''return {
  as: "p",
}'''
      }
    }
    {
      id: "8"
      L: Attr
      P: {
        css:
          '''return `._id {
  font-size: 0.9375rem;
  line-height: 1.6;
  color: ${args.theme.var.color.muted};
  margin: 0;
}`;'''
        displayOrder: 3
        textType: markdown
        componentName: Html
        text:
          '''[Files](/files) is where you see and manage your file list by category. [Support](/support) is where you send a message to our team or see replies. [FAQ](/faq), [Documentation](/docs), and [Tutorial](/tutorial) are help pages you can read anytime. [Billing](/billing) and [Privacy](/privacy) are for your subscription and our privacy policy. You can bookmark or share a page if you want to come back to it later.
'''
        props:
          '''return {
  as: "p",
}'''
      }
    }
    {
      id: "9"
      L: Attr
      P: {
        css:
          '''return `._id {
  margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
}`;'''
        displayOrder: 4
        componentName: Html
        props:
          '''return {
  as: "div"
}'''
      }
    }
    {
      id: "10"
